+   Use 7.0 ↔ 7.2 for this deploy. Before the next promotion, repeat with 7.2
+   ↔ a separate 8.1 candidate **on 8.1 defaults with the three writer overrides
+   removed**. Selecting `Gemfile.next` alone does not test that boundary.
+   `test/integration/rolling_upgrade_test.rb` checks authenticated requests,
